      "body": "## Motivation\n\nA partial Mooncake session-start failure leaves successful sessions open.\n\n## Modifications\n\nRegister the batch for cleanup before checking its results. Add coverage for failure in the first batch and after an earlier successful batch.\n\nRelated: #38639 and #38347. Both retain the cleanup registration after the failure check.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\n`python -m pytest test/registered/unit/mem_cache/test_unified_cache_linker.py::TestMooncakeSessionCleanup`\n\nBoth subtests fail before the fix and pass after it. Full file on macOS: 45 passed, 16 CUDA tests skipped, one Linux-only native-hash failure reproduced on the unchanged baseline. Mooncake/CUDA integration was not run.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nNot applicable; session cleanup ordering only.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Formatting: `pre-commit run --all-files` passed.\n- [x] Focused regression coverage.\n- [x] Documentation: not applicable.\n- [x] Accuracy/speed benchmarks: not applicable.\n- [x] SGLang code style.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #39764003562](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39764003562)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #39764003662](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39764003662)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #39764003542](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39764003542)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
